          "text": "$pq-2p-6$",
          "why": "Multiplies $3$ by the constant only, omitting $3\\times q$."
        },
{
          "text": "$pq-2p+3q+1$",
          "why": "Adds $3$ and $-2$ for the constant instead of multiplying them."
        }
